# CloudWatch Metric Terminology

Example:

```text
Namespace = OnPrem/Ubuntu
Metric    = mem_used_percent
Dimension = Server=LAPTOP-HOO65F3F
Value     = 35%
```

### Namespace

Logical group/container for metrics.

```text
OnPrem/Ubuntu
```

### Metric

What is being measured.

```text
mem_used_percent
cpu_usage_active
disk_used_percent
```

### Dimension

Identifies which resource the metric belongs to.

```text
Server=LAPTOP-HOO65F3F
```

### Dimension Name

```text
Server
```

### Dimension Value

```text
LAPTOP-HOO65F3F
```

### Datapoint

Actual measurement at a particular time.

Example:

```text
Metric    = mem_used_percent
Server    = LAPTOP-HOO65F3F
Timestamp = 00:50
Value     = 35
Unit      = Percent
```

### Period

Time bucket used when querying metrics.

```text
--period 60
```

means:

```text
60 seconds
```

### Statistic

How datapoints are summarized.

Examples:

```text
Average
Minimum
Maximum
Sum
SampleCount
```

